WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.620
Kɔt wɛl to SaloneHCM — Sierra Leone in kɛ human capital management ɛn payroll platform.

2
00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:16.978
A getting-started session yai, a nɔ go sign in fɔs taym, a nɔ go tɔk raund dashboard, a nɔ go lan di navigation, ɛn a nɔ go sho yu aw fɔ diskɔva ɛvri feature we de fɔ yu. Mek wi bigin.

3
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:23.262
Dis na di sign-in page. Ɛnta di wok email ɛn password we yu administrator gie yu.

4
00:00:23.262 --> 00:00:30.626
If yu organization dɔn enable two-factor authentication, dɛn go aks yu bak fɔ six digit code frɔm yu authenticator app.

5
00:00:30.626 --> 00:00:33.658
Naw luk as wi de sign in as system administrator.

6
00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:36.987
Ɛn dis na yu dashboard — di at fɔ SaloneHCM.

7
00:00:36.987 --> 00:00:45.448
Na di tɔp yu go si live key performance indicators: total headcount, mɔnthli payroll cost, pending leave requests, ɛn compliance status.

8
00:00:45.448 --> 00:00:48.434
Ɛvritin de update in real time as yu tim de wok.

9
00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.814
Na di lɛft sayd na yu navigation sidebar.

10
00:00:52.814 --> 00:00:59.754
I de sho ɔnli di modules we yu role ɛn yu organization in plan dɔn unlock — so wetin yu si na wetin yu kin yuz.

11
00:00:59.754 --> 00:01:04.506
Core H R de na di tɔp, payroll ɛn finance de fɔlɔ, dɛn administration tools.

12
00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:08.439
Yu nɔ shɔ usay sɔntin de? Opin di Feature Directory.

13
00:01:08.439 --> 00:01:19.173
Ɛvri module in di platform de ya, dɛn grup am bay function, wit plain-language description ɛn live status — available, requiring a higher plan, ɔ restricted to administrators.

14
00:01:19.173 --> 00:01:21.810
Klik ɛni available card fɔ jɔmp go rayt de.

15
00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:37.386
Fɔ ɛnd, mɛmba tu tin: yu settings page de kɔntrol yu password ɛn two-factor security, ɛn di Training Center — usay yu fɛn dis video — gɛt quick reference cards, knowledge base articles, ɛn certification quizzes fɔ ɛvri role. Yu rɛdi fɔ ɛksplɔ.
